description = "A dense, metallic-based Atomon forged from raw ore deposits deep within cavern layers. 

Its body is reinforced with naturally formed iron plating, making it highly resistant to physical impact. 

Though slow in movement, it compensates with exceptional durability and steady, powerful strikes. 

It is often found guarding mineral-rich zones, reacting aggressively to disturbances in its territory."
